{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"color"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV","text":"MXLColor","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLColor"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLOctaveShift\/color"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxloctaveshift\/color"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"title":"color","roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"symbolKind":"property","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL14MXLOctaveShiftV5colorAA8MXLColorVSgvp","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"color"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV","text":"MXLColor"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"role":"symbol"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLOctaveShift"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The color attribute group indicates the color of an element."}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","title":"IvorMXL","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","kind":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLOctaveShift":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLOctaveShift","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLOctaveShift","title":"MXLOctaveShift","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The octave shift type indicates where notes are shifted up or down from their true pitched values because of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"printing difficulty. Thus a treble clef line noted with 8va will be indicated with an octave-shift down from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the pitch data indicated in the notes. A size of 8 indicates one octave; a size of 15 indicates two octaves."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLOctaveShift","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxloctaveshift"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLOctaveShift/color":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"color"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV","text":"MXLColor"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"color","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLOctaveShift\/color","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The color attribute group indicates the color of an element."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxloctaveshift\/color"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLColor":{"title":"MXLColor","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLColor"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The color type indicates the color of an element. Color may be represented as hexadecimal RGB triples, as in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"HTML, or as hexadecimal ARGB tuples, with the A indicating alpha of transparency. An alpha value of 00 is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"totally transparent; FF is totally opaque. If RGB is used, the A value is assumed to be FF.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLColor","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLColor"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlcolor"}}}